  lore:
  - id: paper-trail/0
    title: Rounding errors
    company: MORROW FINANCIAL
    contract: Paper Trail
    text: 'MORROW / INCIDENT 441: Duplicate balances correlate exactly with the migration date. Customer support has filed nineteen matching reports. The classification remains ''individual payment dispute''.'
  - id: paper-trail/1
    title: The second signature
    company: MORROW FINANCIAL
    contract: Paper Trail
    text: 'Ledger maintenance memo: Both primary and mirror require correction. An automated reconciliation job restores whichever record carries the older authorization stamp. A single correction will disappear overnight.'
  - id: paper-trail/2
    title: A letter never sent
    company: MORROW FINANCIAL
    contract: Paper Trail
    text: 'Unsent message from a collections clerk: I can see the charge twice. I can see the payment once. The script tells me to say the account is accurate. I am keeping copies of everything.'
